  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_039) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt (a more advanced model) could further improve performance, while keeping other components (image encoder, aggregation, fusion) consistent. This comparison isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, which is a critical design choice, and leverages the strong prior evidence for the other components."
